  "description": "Decoupled dispatch for Trax .NET trains: ITrainBus runs the train registered for an input's type, so callers never reference a concrete train. Adds assembly scanning, the train registry, [TraxAuthorize] train authorization and concurrency limits. Install it when callers should hand over an input rather than inject a specific train.",
